**Tips for Success**
1. Focus on understanding, not critiquing or improving the code
2. Use precise, specific questions in your prompts
3. Include enough code context for the AI to give meaningful responses
4. Document your process, including false starts or misconceptions
5. Draw diagrams to help visualize relationships between components
6. Use the AI to validate your understanding, not just to explain the code

